    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/0d81f3838fb89a6532843afe58b62ffd.poster.avif?t=1725068644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/0d81f3838fb89a6532843afe58b62ffd.webm?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to <strong>Catacomb Rogue Clawsaders</strong>, where you'll be treated to a gameplay experience that will have you meow-tivated for hours on end! In this Deckbuilding roguelite you will navigate though the catacomb while gathering an assortments of cards that will help you power up against you foes, but there is more! You can equip your favorite fancy hat and even choose the purrfect weapon for your gameplay!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your build!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/4e979a18327fdd634ad15d979c9bf239.poster.avif?t=1725068644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/4e979a18327fdd634ad15d979c9bf239.webm?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/4e979a18327fdd634ad15d979c9bf239.mp4?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Start by choosing your kitty (we have some of the most cute and ferocious cats for you to pick from! ) Each one of them have its own unique bonus, so choose wisely! After that you can equip your magic staff and an accessory. All of them have unique perks so you can mix and match different cats, staves and accessories to make unique and fun builds! Oh, And you can upgrade each one of them to unlock its full potential.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the game!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/245bac135566bb9b2a83430a9f8630d9.poster.avif?t=1725068644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/245bac135566bb9b2a83430a9f8630d9.webm?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/245bac135566bb9b2a83430a9f8630d9.mp4?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After conquering a wave of enemies, you'll have the opportunity to construct a deck of cards with various buffs, aiding your progress. And the more you progress, more types of cards will appear for you to choose from.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick your cards!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/b52a04576f2d923e8d845c8303177d45.poster.avif?t=1725068644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/b52a04576f2d923e8d845c8303177d45.webm?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/b52a04576f2d923e8d845c8303177d45.mp4?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>...And so much more!</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different kitty cats for you to choose;<br></li><li>Magical staves with unique powers;<br></li><li>Cute and wonderful hats;<br></li><li>X cards to make your build more powerful;<br></li><li>Upgrade system to maximize you build; <br></li><li>1 rat;</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start again!</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/218819de766afe69a9fa044ef85c1997.poster.avif?t=1725068644\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/218819de766afe69a9fa044ef85c1997.webm?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/218819de766afe69a9fa044ef85c1997.mp4?t=1725068644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Are you prepared to wield your enchanted staff, sharpen those feline claws, and embark on an epic adventure into the realm of Catacomb Rogue Clawsaders? Get ready for a whimsical and action-packed journey!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't forget to wishlist!</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/5fef3e764d8de68395cebce6bd13dbb8.poster.avif?t=1725068644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452890/extras/5fef3e764d8de68395cebce6bd13dbb8.webp?t=1725068644\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>",
